 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 40-2§8 Packet summary for this part: menu type ids (8, V16): crafter_3x3 7, blast_furnace 10, brewing_stand 11, furnace 14, smoker 22" TO TL-CASE
