     MOVE "acceptance US12 40-2§8 Packet summary for this part: packet table (8): Container Set Data 0x13, Container Button Click 0x11 (not used by this part), Container Click 0x12, Slot State Changed" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
